==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's standard illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Scarlet & Violet|Sprigatito|13}} from the {{TCG|Scarlet & Violet}} expansion.
**Both cards have the {{m|Leafage}} attack; this is a [[move]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Sprigatito}} can learn.
*This card's shiny rare illustration features a {{Shiny}} {{p|Sprigatito}}.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Violet}}.

